          "label": "Description",
          "content": "Shaped squarish figures form a checker board or diamond trellis pattern, enclosing a simple floral form on dotted ground, which alternates with floral sprays. At left, original margin of paper. Original colors appear along edges, where paper has been folded. Paper is gray and coarse; green colors have high gloss. This wallpaper was formerly used as a book cover."
